WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.620
This is my assistant Rocky.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.410
I'm Rita. Doctor Rita.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.580
I guess I did it again.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.710
If we had that girl's power...

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.540
I believe that I told you

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.130
not to disappoint me.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:18.340
Join forces with me!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.720
Humans and demons...

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.800
I really don't understand.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:27.680
Damn you filthy humans!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.320
There can be no mistake.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.490
Heaven
Vanaheimr

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:43.950
We sensed the power
in the royal capital Anatae.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.870
What is the possibility that it's the child?

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.450
We do not know yet.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.790
But it resembles the same surge
that we detected two years ago.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.620
In any case,

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:56.420
please intensify the search in the royal capital.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.250
As you wish.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.630
If that child is still alive,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.050
we must find him no matter what.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:11.430
To regain the faith
man once had in the gods,

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:14.980
we will need him.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.570
Suck it up. You're a demon, aren't you?

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.870
Demons still feel pain.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:34.790
You keep this up
and you really will get yourself killed.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.670
How am I still alive?

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.460
Don't ask me.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.100
Unbelievable.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.420
RAGE OF BAHAMUT

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.440
Ready!

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.690
Go!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:57.030
The winner is Nina Drango!

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.290
That's fifteen wins in a row!

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.370
All right.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.830
Are you up next, Mr. Macho?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.670
That's a hundred rupees to enter!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.510
This money will be mine.

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:15.010
Best of luck to you.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.050
Are you all set?

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.180
Ready! Go!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.980
Now, now, who's next?

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.650
What's that girl supposed to be?

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:38.160
Nobody likes a sore loser.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:50.960
It's ironic that you two are the
only gods still living among men.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.300
Your partner is fully enjoying this mortal realm.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.510
Ready! Go!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.440
-The winner is Nina!
-Yes!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.820
Thanks for coming!

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:20.910
What do you want?

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:26.460
Do you know of a child
with two different colored eyes?

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.340
Sure don't.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.210
There's a high chance he's in the capital.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.630
What exactly does this brat have?

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:43.180
Must be a pretty big deal if you're sniffing around
down here in mortal form.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:46.520
You don't need to know.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:52.190
But if you do find the child,

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:56.820
Lord Gabriel would certainly consider
allowing you back into heaven.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:02.530
You must feel humiliated,
having been exiled from heaven

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.080
and forced to oversee the bounty hunters.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.620
What do you mean, exiled?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.170
I left on my own, idiot!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:15.590
Even so, this will likely be your last chance
to return to heaven.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:20.680
Come tell me if you find the child.
Understood?

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:24.680
Okay, that's it! The winner is Nina!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.310
Idiot.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.070
Now, now. Who's next?

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.360
Nobody? Nobody wants a try?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:41.780
Pathetic!

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.820
Come on!

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:46.160
Yeah, come on. Come on.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.620
You, there! The handsome young man!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.590
Would you like to challenge
this superpowered young sweetheart?

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.260
Oh, you're running away?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.970
Young people these days have no can-do spirit.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.180
A handsome one indeed.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:16.400
That's a hundred rupees to enter.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.150
I have no money.

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.910
Is this real?

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.500
Why are you blindfolded?

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:40.800
It's to help her focus on the match.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.380
Now, hold out your hand!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.730
Are you all set?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.310
Ready! Go!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.910
This guy's not bad!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.960
Whoa, awesome!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.950
I'm so sorry!

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.730
Who are you?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.240
I'm Nina.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.450
Nina!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.540
-Who was he?
-Who knows?

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.920
I've never seen him before.

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.860
All right, that's all for today!

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.480
Now, scram!

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.660
Looks like we brought in another big haul today!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.950
In these last ten days,

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:21.040
six aristocrats' mansions
were attacked by the rag demon.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.880
Three slavers' and traffickers' deals too.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:26.260
A total of fifty-six people have been slain.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:31.180
The Orleans Knights and the Onyx Soldiers
have failed to capture the rag demon.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:34.760
We currently have no specific plan of action
to address this situation.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:39.640
In today's war council, we will discuss
the rag demon's next possible appearance.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:43.270
There is no need to speculate
on where he will appear next.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:45.570
I will take command myself.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:48.400
Line up the demons in the city's central plaza.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.030
Then execute them on the spot.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.080
If we continue slaughtering demons,

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.160
the rag demon will have to show himself.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.290
My Lord, please!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.630
What is it?

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:07.250
I oppose provoking the demons any further.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.760
Captain, I don't think this is a good idea.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.350
If we keep casually taking
the lives of demons and gods,

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:18.640
they will eventually band together
and rise up against mankind.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.270
And what about that is a problem?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.230
If they rise up against us,
we merely need to crush them.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.150
-But—
-Captain Kaisar.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:34.110
Defend the demons too strongly
and you'll invite needless suspicion.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:43.870
Tonight we draw out the rag demon and finish him.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:48.130
There is a possibility that the red dragon
that thwarted us could reappear.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.340
Kill anything that gets in your way.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:57.100
Rage of Bahamut

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.310
Come on.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.570
Oh, yeah! That feels so good!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.150
You worked hard today, after all.

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:17.370
Now, I wonder if the soup is done.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:25.420
That's the royal emblem.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.290
There's no way an average person
would have a real one.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.630
It has to be fake.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.470
What's wrong, missy?

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.310
Are you thinking about the man
who had that ring?

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:48.270
I don't know! I already forgot about him!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.900
Was he more handsome than Azazel?

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.070
I told you I've forgotten already!

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:03.910
You're a decade too young to be
obsessing over boys, idiot.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.080
Well, let's eat.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.630
Is this going to be enough soup?

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.880
Nina eats five people's worth.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.340
Isn't that the truth!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:19.640
We had to spend half of our earnings today on food.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.680
I'm starving!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.640
Let's eat!

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.480
-Let's eat!
-Let's eat!

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:45.040
By the way, Nina, how did you end up
living with this drunk and this duck?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.290
I don't remember ever agreeing to it, idiot!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.420
And I am not a duck!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.210
I am a god!

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:56.670
My teacher told me that if I went to the royal capital,
I should find someone named Bacchus

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.380
who lives in a weird carriage.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.010
-Teacher?
-Yup.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.220
My teacher told me.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:07.480
It was my first time in the capital,
and there was so much I didn't know.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.020
But I spotted this carriage right away.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.560
I mean, it really was a weird carriage.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.980
Don't make fun of my carriage.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:18.780
And what did this teacher of
yours teach you?

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.410
Bounty hunting.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.200
Bounty hunting?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.280
You're a bounty hunter?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.660
I haven't collected any bounties yet though.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:29.120
I mean, there aren't any bounties to catch.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:31.710
But look at this!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.040
What?

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.750
My teacher put it on me

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.960
and said it was the mark of a
real bounty hunter.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:40.550
That's a fake, idiot.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:44.640
Only a god can wear
a bounty hunter's bracer.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.430
What, really?

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.980
My teacher is the worst.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:58.190
At any rate, these bracers
haven't been very useful lately.

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.990
Thanks to that kid, Charioce,

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:05.160
the rag demon is the only bounty left.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.700
I've basically been put out of business.

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:11.830
And Azazel is the rag demon.
Can't really turn him in now.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:16.040
Besides, letting such a young girl
become a bounty hunter?

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:18.010
What an irresponsible teacher!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.800
Telling her to look me up
without even asking me!

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:23.010
It's ridiculous!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.970
And the bracer's a fake.
He doesn't sound very trustworthy.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.770
Yeah, Favaro wasn't exactly trustworthy.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.690
-Favaro?
-Favaro?

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.210
Damn it!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:17:01.550
The Orleans Knights are supposed to be His Highness's
personal guard, and this is how we're treated?

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.430
How is this different from the rank and file?

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:07.600
In any case, these are quite the forces.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.720
It's as if we're going to war.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.890
And what of it?

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:14.980
More importantly, where is Captain Kaisar?

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:17.810
I haven't seen him in a while.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:18.980
Honestly.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.940
The way the captain acted

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:23.740
only weakens our position!

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:32.370
Thank you for the food!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.960
I was certainly surprised by your appetite.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:40.420
But hearing that you knew Afro
was the biggest shock of the night.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.800
You know a lot about my teacher, don't you?

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.340
What was he like?

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:47.970
I didn't know him that well.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:52.310
We only spent a little time traveling together.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:58.230
If you want to learn more about him,
there's a person in the capital who could help you.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.770
Really?

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.690
Do you mean an old lover?

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:08.660
No, but he certainly knows Afro
much better than I do.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:11.620
Where can I find this person?

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.160
Rita!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.590
There you are, Rita.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.920
What a coincidence, Captain.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:28.760
We were just talking about you.

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:29.930
Captain?

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.760
Nina, this is Kaisar.

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.810
He's Rocky's father.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.020
He's one of the knights at the castle.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.070
I'm so sorry about then!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:54.080
You're the girl with the whip.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:56.500
Rita! Where is Azazel right now?

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.370
Why would I know?

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.460
Do you have any idea where he might be?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.250
If I don't do something, Azazel will be killed!

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.810
If you keep smiling,

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:21.520
I just might not die tonight.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:28.110
Whatever happens, don't go near there.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.410
If I don't come back,

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.910
go to the zombie girl.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.630
Hold on!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:49.090
Kaisar, go stop her!

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:50.550
Okay!

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.520
You two, wake up already!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:01.690
What?

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:25.090
Tonight, His Highness is leading an overwhelming force
to end things with the rag demon once and for all!

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.460
Azazel!

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:30.380
You can't die!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:05.540
Show yourself, Rag Demon!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.500
You're here, aren't you?

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:12.050
If you do not show yourself,
I will behead these demons one by one!

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:14.630
Where is the captain?

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.800
Keep it down.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.650
There! It's the rag demon!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.080
We finally meet,

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.000
Rag Demon!

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:59.930
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:04.100
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:08.150
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:12.400
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:14.860
So fragile
Yet strong

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:17.030
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:20.910
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:25.290
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:29.380
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:33.800
Let's end it all today

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:38.050
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:42.260
Let's end it all today

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:46.430
I've taken my last pointless breath

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:55.570
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:55.740 --> 00:23:00.450
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:23:00.620 --> 00:23:07.250
A new morning is coming

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:36.940
What's wrong, Rag Demon?

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:38.360
I'm right here!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.870
-I'm the zombie girl, Rita.
-Kaisar here!

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:50.040
You're so loud.

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:52.460
What was once my own arm is called...
Rocky?

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:54.590
It's not even Kaisar Lidfard.
Just Rocky!

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:56.250
Rocky sounds more cute.

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.760
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"Firestarter".

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:01.130
-You got a problem with that?
-No, no I don't.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:03.180
Baha Baha Baha Soul

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.550
Baha Soul!!

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:07.600
Will you stay tuned for next time?

00:24:10.020 --> 00:24:11.020
What is this...
